      limTag: "Shown only:", lim: () => "Two rows, one arm (olm125). The reject sentence and the proof field co-occur; it is not shown that the same proposition was rejected and revived. Positions inside the body are not in the inventory (panels not to scale). The instrument is not the proof; correctness is not read. " + SC.en,
